[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6423.71, "timestamp": "01:47:03", "text": "あなたが今おそらく"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6438.629, "timestamp": "01:47:18", "text": "ジョナは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6441.35, "timestamp": "01:47:21", "text": "カヌーから目覚めた直後に鶏を投げます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6443.72, "timestamp": "01:47:23", "text": "そう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6449.83, "timestamp": "01:47:29", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6456.79, "timestamp": "01:47:36", "text": "ジョンがここにいない理由は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6458.629, "timestamp": "01:47:38", "text": "カヌーを階段から押し下ろしているからです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6460.79, "timestamp": "01:47:40", "text": "公平に言うと、技術的には実際に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6462.629, "timestamp": "01:47:42", "text": "鳥はいます。鳥が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6464.87, "timestamp": "01:47:44", "text": "通常運んでいるのです。そう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6469.03, "timestamp": "01:47:49", "text": "そう。だから、いつも彼の背中に乗っています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6472.149, "timestamp": "01:47:52", "text": "鳥が鳥を"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6478.87, "timestamp": "01:47:58", "text": "おはよう、カ。そして"}]